{"type": "concept", "subtype": "distinction", "title": "家庭与婚姻的区别", "content": "家庭和婚姻是两个不同的概念，不能混为一谈。家庭幸福不等于婚姻幸福。许多夫妻过着“有家庭没有婚姻”的生活，即两人像亲人或公司伙伴一样共同承担经济责任、养育孩子，但缺乏情感亲密和婚姻关系。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["界限"], "tags": ["家庭", "婚姻", "区别"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-2e14ad8611c9-c001:a001", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-2e14ad8611c9", "blocks": ["b00002", "b00003"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-2e14ad8611c9-c001:a002", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "当夫妻像亲人或公司伙伴一样生活，缺乏情感亲密时", "reason": "a002具体描述了a001中提到的“有家庭没有婚姻”的状态。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-2e14ad8611c9-c001:a002", "kind": "same_source_point", "condition": "Read both records and the shared source point; this is not a causal assertion.", "reason": "s-2e14ad8611c9-c001:u001", "evidence": "point_source_review"}, {"target": "legacy:xg-c-05", "kind": "equivalent", "condition": "共同适用：区分家庭与婚姻幸福的概念；legacy描述具体状态，候选补充家庭幸福不等于婚姻幸福。", "reason": "候选概括了同一状态并区分概念，与旧原子一致。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}, {"target": "legacy:xg-r-02", "kind": "complements", "condition": "两者均讨论家庭与婚姻不可混淆。", "reason": "候选澄清家庭幸福不等于婚姻幸福，支撑旧原子的反向情况。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-2e14ad8611c9-c001:u001"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "definition", "title": "有家庭没有婚姻的状态", "content": "“有家庭没有婚姻”指夫妻像亲人或公司伙伴一样生活，共同还贷、养育孩子，但分床睡、很久没有聊天谈心，彼此之间不但不感兴趣，有时还觉得厌恶。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["界限"], "tags": ["有家庭没有婚姻", "婚姻质量"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-2e14ad8611c9-c001:a002", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-2e14ad8611c9", "blocks": ["b00003", "b00004"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-2e14ad8611c9-c001:a001", "kind": "same_source_point", "condition": "Read both records and the shared source point; this is not a causal assertion.", "reason": "s-2e14ad8611c9-c001:u001", "evidence": "point_source_review"}, {"target": "legacy:xg-c-05", "kind": "equivalent", "condition": "共同适用：夫妻共同还贷养家但缺乏情感亲密的情境；legacy与候选均描述分床睡、不谈心、像公司伙伴、可能厌恶。", "reason": "定义完全匹配。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}, {"target": "legacy:xg-r-02", "kind": "complements", "condition": "两者均讨论“有家庭没有婚姻”的状态定义。", "reason": "候选定义有家庭没有婚姻：像亲人/公司伙伴，共同还贷养娃但缺乏情感亲密，与旧原子前提一致。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-2e14ad8611c9-c001:u001"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "父母相爱对孩子大脑的影响", "content": "当孩子看到父母彼此相爱、拥抱、开玩笑、嬉笑时，他们的大脑会释放大量让他们感到兴奋的激素，这种激素可以促进孩子身体各方面的发育，并且孩子也会因此感到高兴。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["父母相爱", "孩子大脑", "激素"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-2e14ad8611c9-c001:a003", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-2e14ad8611c9", "blocks": ["b00005"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-2e14ad8611c9-c001:a004", "kind": "supports", "condition": "当孩子看到父母拥抱时", "reason": "“父母相爱对孩子大脑的影响”解释了“孩子参与父母拥抱的行为”中孩子感到兴奋的生理机制，支持该行为表现。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": ""}, {"target": "s-2e14ad8611c9-c001:a016", "kind": "supports", "condition": "当父母幸福地生活在一起时", "reason": "“父母相爱对孩子大脑的影响”说明了父母幸福生活给孩子带来的生理益处，支持“父母能给孩子的最好礼物”这一主张，原方向颠倒。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "revised", "review_notes": "方向修正"}, {"target": "s-2e14ad8611c9-c001:r001", "kind": "supports", "condition": "当父母婚姻为孩子带来祝福时", "reason": "“父母相爱对孩子大脑的影响”提供了具体机制，支持“父母婚姻为孩子带来的祝福”中兴奋和身体发育等益处，原方向颠倒。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "revised", "review_notes": "方向修正"}, {"target": "s-2e14ad8611c9-c001:v2-n001", "kind": "complements", "condition": "无特定条件", "reason": "源中孩子因父母拥抱感到安全和兴奋，候选从生理角度解释父母相爱使孩子大脑释放激素从而兴奋和促进发育，补充了源中现象的机制。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}, {"target": "legacy:xg-r-02", "kind": "complements", "condition": "两者均讨论父母相爱对孩子身体发育的促进作用。", "reason": "候选补充生理机制：看到父母相爱让孩子大脑释放兴奋激素，促进身体发育。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-2e14ad8611c9-c001:u003"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
