{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "保证婚姻质量的第一个要素：尽早寻求帮助", "content": "保证婚姻质量的第一个要素是尽早寻求帮助。很多夫妻拖延寻求帮助，美国婚姻需要帮助的夫妻平均拖六年才寻求帮助。在高达50%的离婚中，超过一半发生在婚姻的前七年。因此，当认为婚姻不行了才去见婚姻辅导时，已经有点晚了。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["婚姻质量", "寻求帮助", "婚姻辅导"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-2e14ad8611c9-c001:a007", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-2e14ad8611c9", "blocks": ["b00015", "b00016", "b00017"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-2e14ad8611c9-c001:a008", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "讲师订婚后的行为", "reason": "a008是a007中“尽早寻求帮助”的具体例子。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-2e14ad8611c9-c001:a009", "kind": "supports", "condition": "当人们不知道婚姻是否需要辅导时", "reason": "a009说明了很多人不知道婚姻需要辅导，支持a007中尽早寻求帮助的重要性。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-2e14ad8611c9-c001:a010", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "丈夫被妻子拽着参加婚姻辅导", "reason": "a010是a007中寻求婚姻辅导的具体例子，展示了参与后的积极反馈。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-2e14ad8611c9-c001:r009", "kind": "same_source_point", "condition": "Read both records and the shared source point; this is not a causal assertion.", "reason": "s-2e14ad8611c9-c001:u016", "evidence": "point_source_review"}, {"target": "s-2e14ad8611c9-c001:r010", "kind": "same_source_point", "condition": "Read both records and the shared source point; this is not a causal assertion.", "reason": "s-2e14ad8611c9-c001:u016", "evidence": "point_source_review"}, {"target": "s-2e14ad8611c9-c001:r011", "kind": "same_source_point", "condition": "Read both records and the shared source point; this is not a causal assertion.", "reason": "s-2e14ad8611c9-c001:u016", "evidence": "point_source_review"}, {"target": "s-2e14ad8611c9-c001:r012", "kind": "same_source_point", "condition": "Read both records and the shared source point; this is not a causal assertion.", "reason": "s-2e14ad8611c9-c001:u016", 